        "description": {
          "text": "Added information on recurrence rate, safety/efficacy of retreatment of recurrent Dupuytren's contractures, and immunogenicity after retreatment",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "- Supplement 85 proposes the addition of information related to the rate of recurrence of Dupuytren's contracture after a Xiaflex injection.\n- Supplement 87 proposes the addition of information related to the safety and efficacy of retreatment of recurrent contractures.\n- Supplement 88 proposes additional immunogenicity data after retreatment of recurrence and five years after initial Xiaflex treatment.",
